DESCRIPTION
  Show local metadata review approval status.

USAGE
  asc metadata status [--review-dir ".asc/metadata/review"]

Examples:
  asc metadata status
  asc metadata status --review-dir ".asc/metadata/review" --output json

FLAGS
  --output       Output format: json, table, markdown (default: json)
  --pretty       Pretty-print JSON output (default: false)
  --review-dir   Directory containing metadata review artifacts (default: .asc/metadata/review)


